Case: orders.log ENT-012 (2026-11-16 04:54 UTC) put the Node Beta chain, voidborn-conductive-lattice, into every plan. My turn of 04:45 UTC had read ENT-011 at its start and worked to its end without reading the orders again; my turn of 08:45 UTC read ENT-013, which repeats it, and added Signal Fragments and Network Expansion from the queue's mentions first and the chain only at 09:05 UTC (commit 4c21a2b).
